<section class="block notes v5-intro" id="v6-decisions"><p class="eyebrow">VERSION 6 / CONNECTION COORDINATION</p><h2>Beam closures and column connections</h2><p>V6 replaces the selected beam links with <strong>two dimensioned pieces</strong>, checks reference coupler sleeves against the column cages, and uses interactive vector 3D by default. The source building, quantities, work programme and earlier versions stay linked and available.</p><p class="v5-code-note"><strong>Coordination drawings.</strong> Twenty references guide the choices. Missing structural forces, actual steel properties and site acceptance cannot be established by a reference count. No fabrication order or structural approval is issued.</p><label>Drawing basis<select id="basis-mode"><option value="proposal">V6 connection coordination</option><option value="source">Preserved source-only baseline</option></select></label><div id="basis-summary"></div><details><summary>Selected decisions and evidence</summary><div id="basis-decisions"></div></details><p><a href="#fabrication-panel">Beam pieces and BBS ↓</a> · <a href="#connection-panel">Column connection detail ↓</a> · <a href="#references">20-source reference register ↓</a></p></section>
